<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA-SOCCER CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA-SOCCER CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Lithuanian soccer</p>
<p>championship matches played on Sunday.</p>
<p>Ekranas-Violmeta 2 Ekranas  0 (1:0)</p>
<p>    Kaunas	     1 Zalgiris 2 (1:1)</p>
<p>    Panerys	    0 Kareda   2 (0:1)</p>
<p>    Atlantas	   1 Inkaras  1 (0:0)</p>
<p>    Standings		  Pl  W  D  L   F  A   Pts</p>
<p>    1.Kareda		   25  17 6  2  57  11  57</p>
<p>    3.Zalgiris		 25  17 4  4  55  16  55</p>
<p>    3.Inkaras		  25  14 8  3  39  14  49</p>
<p>    4.FBC Kaunas	     26  10 5 11  28  30  35</p>
<p>    5.Ekranas		  26   8 9  9  28  31  33</p>
<p>    6.Panerys		  25   4 7 14  15  39  19</p>
<p>    7.Atlantas		 25   4 5 16  18  58  17</p>
<p>    8.Zalgiris-Volmeta     25   3 4 18  15  56  13</p>
